From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:40:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ptm: Log titles started from the HOME Menu in the play
 history

0033 logged a title only when emulation started or stopped. Titles the HOME Menu
starts run as new processes in the same session, so they were missing from the
Activity Log (Mii Plaza and the Activity Log itself when started from the HOME Menu).

The kernel now tells a listener when a process starts running or exits; PTM logs
applications and applets (title ID high 0x00040000, 0x00040010, 0x00040030) as
launched and closed with the emulated time. Titles still running when emulation stops
are logged as closed then.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
